      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004BFF0190A3621153BB6E9650994E004E0B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，那個……\n您的錢好像不夠呢。",
