      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好～囉！謝謝！\n讓您久等了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這造型很適合您呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
